{"name":"Pagination","description":"Move through a large result set in separate pages · Pagination breaks a long result set into stable pages and works well when people need to return to a position or compare totals. Keep filters and sorting when the page changes. For a casual content feed, loading more items may feel more natural.","quote":"There are too many items for one page. Add page numbers at the bottom.","agentPrompt":"Add pagination to the audit log and keep page number and filters in the URL. Preserve filters across page changes and restore the same result after refresh, back navigation, or sharing. Verify the first, middle, last, and empty pages.","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-pagination\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>Pagination</h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">You might say</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">There are too many items for one page. Add page numbers at the bottom.</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">Move through a large result set in separate pages</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>Pagination breaks a long result set into stable pages and works well when people need to return to a position or compare totals. Keep filters and sorting when the page changes. For a casual content feed, loading more items may feel more natural.</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"pg-live\">\n    <input type=\"radio\" name=\"pgl\" id=\"pg-p1\" checked>\n    <input type=\"radio\" name=\"pgl\" id=\"pg-p2\">\n    <input type=\"radio\" name=\"pgl\" id=\"pg-p3\">\n    <div class=\"pg-ctl\">\n      <span class=\"pagination-item\">‹</span>\n      <label class=\"pagination-item\" for=\"pg-p1\">1</label>\n      <label class=\"pagination-item\" for=\"pg-p2\">2</label>\n      <label class=\"pagination-item\" for=\"pg-p3\">3</label>\